      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the External LLM**\n\nI'm solidifying the external service choice for this summarization project. I've decided to go with Google Cloud's Vertex AI as the LLM provider. This decision is shaping the structure of the Python file, `summarize_text.py`, as I plan the initial API calls. I am preparing to implement these API calls in the code.\n\n\n**Outlining the Python File**\n\nI'm now outlining the `summarize_text.py` file, focusing on the Vertex AI integration. I'll import `vertexai` and its preview models. The core of the file will be the `summarize_text` function, taking the text as input. I'll initialize the Vertex AI client within, then select a model like \"text-bison@002\", crafting a summarization prompt for the LLM call. The function will then return the condensed text. I plan on starting the coding process now.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789820872098,
          "start": 1789820870133
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b9a31df5001X02C9HN8wUN6sW",
